{"id":"aufstand","lemma":"Aufstand","pos":"noun","rank":3257,"glosses":["uprising, insurrection"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/De-Aufstand.ogg/De-Aufstand.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Aufstandes","plural":"Aufstände"},"examples":[{"text":"Mach keinen öffentlichen Aufstand.","en":"Don't make a scene in public.","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"public","l":"öffentlich"},null]},{"text":"Als ich aufstand, war es draußen noch dunkel.","en":"When I woke up, it was still dark outside.","words":[{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"outside"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"dark"}]},{"text":"Die Armee schlug den Aufstand nieder.","en":"The army quelled the rebellion.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"army"},{"g":"to beat","l":"schlagen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"low"}]},{"text":"Er hat den Aufstand angezettelt.","en":"He instigated the riot.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"instigated, incited"}]},{"text":"Ein Aufstand brach aus.","en":"A revolt broke out.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to break","l":"brechen"},{"g":"out of / from"}]}]}